{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，2001年为辛巳年，命主时年8岁，处于乙卯大运（0-9岁，七杀运）。流年辛巳，天干辛金为食神，地支巳火为正印。原局日主己土生于辰月，得月令，时支子水偏财，年柱癸酉食神生财，整体身旺喜财官。\n\n2001年辛巳年，流年地支巳火与月支辰土、日支未土构成火土相生，增强日主力量。天干辛金食神透出，与年干癸水食神并见，食神主表达、才艺、口才。大运乙卯七杀，主压力、竞争，但流年食神制杀（辛金克乙木），有化解压力、展现才华之象。巳火为正印，主学业、文书、名誉，与食神组合，利于演讲、表演类活动。\n\n原局时支子水与流年巳火为“子巳暗合”，有暗中变化，但无冲克凶象。综合判断，此年学业表现佳，有因才艺获奖之事，而非伤病、意外或休学。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "f813e88e5ba5296cb1b854ca7dbe5a13577cdc4843426707bf91d81c8bbd7e09", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_limited_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3543, "response_id": "33dafc82-fbed-4317-a17d-ac915c57d220", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 439, "completion_tokens": 270, "total_tokens": 709, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 55}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
